  "response": {
    "html": "<h1 data-chunk-id=\"88a4f5a3-00bb-4955-b777-27f71f9ffbac\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;border-bottom:3px solid #0d47a1;padding-bottom:6px\">Nebula Drift - Mechanics</h1>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"bd24cdea-bf59-452e-8877-1b01108c5497\" style=\"background-color:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #1565c0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9pt;color:#37474f\">Vantage Nine Studios - internal - sub-document of the Nebula Drift GDD. Source of truth for every tunable number.</p>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"bfd9bc48-ba18-4dd0-8295-0d7b2712b3ce\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">How to read this document</h2>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"49f7b7ae-6c0a-48cd-8c55-20873449500c\" style=\"background-color:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #1565c0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9pt;color:#37474f\">One section per mechanic. Every tunable number in the game\nappears here exactly once and is referenced from the GDD as prose. If a number\nappears in two places, this one wins.</p>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"1759f1f8-d36d-4239-afc6-80f0ae243bd1\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Dash</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"e9ce8908-e099-4ee3-a5fb-6eb3ce65cca1\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Distance</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">5.5 m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Two tiles. Tuned so a dash clears the standard gap.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Cooldown</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">1.2 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Short enough to chain, long enough to read.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">I-frames</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">0.15 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Start of dash only.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"1ba83a95-000e-4912-9d1c-ccc8ba12080e\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Wall-run</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"d3c3500c-7abe-4bee-99c3-bbf7fbbe10d9\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Max duration</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">2.0 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Falls off rather than stopping dead.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Speed retained</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">85%</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Deliberately lossy: wall-run is a connector, not a route.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Re-attach window</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">0.4 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Allows a corner without a full reset.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"16c5de30-0c31-4f91-a47c-e21b96e4766a\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Grapple</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"0f6479ac-83ab-4074-b3f1-7a7f0d7a3efa\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Range</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">18 m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Reads at speed; longer felt like teleporting.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Cooldown</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">8 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">The longest cooldown in the game. All level pacing assumes it.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Speed on release</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">140%</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">The only system that converts height into speed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Attach angle</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">60 deg cone</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Forgiving, because the camera is not.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"717ed4f4-6c1d-4758-8cab-67791b3f5b60\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Overheat pulse</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"1de733e9-0e65-4d34-9fd6-33290690d64a\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Radius</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">4 m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Defensive only. Never damages.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Cooldown</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">6 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Paced against the grapple so they compete.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Stagger duration</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">1.1 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Enough to route past, not enough to farm.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"22c8f931-a01d-40e2-9a25-8926f0014f69\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Salvage economy</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"6e053c69-5b09-42e0-b01d-9367b271c78c\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Base yield per node</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">12 units</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Flat. Rarity lives in placement, not in rolls.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Upgrade cost curve</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">60 / 140 / 260</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Three tiers, no branching.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Decay on death</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">0%</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Death costs progress through the sector, not currency.</td></tr></tbody></table>",
